{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53937","headline":"感圣皇之化有炖煌都法师悟真上人特疏来朝因成四韵 · 建初","name":"感圣皇之化有炖煌都法师悟真上人特疏来朝因成四韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"名出炖煌郡，身游日月宫。\n柳烟轻古塞，边草靡春风。\n鼓舞千年圣，车书万里同。\n褐衣特献疏，不战四夷空。\n（同前。\n原署：「报恩寺赐紫僧建初。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"建初","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53937.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53937","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}